# Core Project Contract

- Read and follow `AGENTS.md` before making repository changes.
- Treat committed docs as the source of truth; local-only files can add context but cannot be the only copy of project policy.
- Work on a `dev/*` branch for repository modifications.
- Do not commit secrets, screenshots, database backups, generated artifacts, or scratch files.
- For code changes, run `luacheck VolumeSliders spec` and `busted . --verbose` before completion when available.
- Do not merge PRs or create release tags without explicit user direction.
